<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Westpac leads Burns Philp MTN issue.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Westpac leads Burns Philp MTN issue.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westpac Bank Corporation said on Monday it has been mandated to arrange a A$250 million domestic medium term note programme for Burns Philp Treasury (Australia) Ltd.</p>
<p>The MTN is guaranteed by the parent, Burns, Philp &amp; Co Ltd, and joining Westpac as dealers on the programme would be ANZ and BZW Australia Ltd.</p>
</text>
